HOW TO READ A PLANT (docs/queue-2026-11-06b.md rule 15)
  A plant is a fault I introduce. CAUGHT means at least one test turns red
  because of it, which is the good outcome. MISSED means everything stayed
  green, which is a finding.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
