  1. Narrow the try/except in both GUI smoke tests to the import and Tk()
     creation, so a broken GUI fails instead of skipping. F3.15-F1, S13-P2.
  2. Rewrite the privacy-shutter plant so it omits a tile inside the model's
     refresh path, not by hand after the fact. F3.15-F2, S17-P1.
